    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d953">

                <pb facs="1012" n="726" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg726"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111Ap4/24</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Embassy to the
                            Department of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi>
                </p>
                <p>The British Embassy has the honour to inform the State Department that the
                    British Government reserves all rights under accepted principles and practice of
                    international law with regard to the <hi rendition="#italic">Appam</hi>, and
                    that any action taken in the matter by the owners in maintenance of their
                    interests is not in any way to be considered as prejudicing any claim advanced
                    or to be advanced by the British Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1916-02-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 15, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
